TARGET
- Desktop app for my laptop. Detect my OS and build for it first (Windows or macOS), keeping the code cross-platform (Windows, macOS, Linux).
- Stack: Tauri 2 (Rust backend) + React + TypeScript + Tailwind for the settings UI. Prefer Rust for the audio, inference and paste hot path. Justify any deviation in /docs/decisions.md.
